 "summary_en": "I found no public sign that this runs in South Savo. KYS's lung cancer care pathway (Pohjois-Savo, 2021) says a thoracic surgeon attends KYS's own weekly team meeting, where every lung cancer patient's treatment is decided. Eloisa's lung disease page for Mikkeli and Savonlinna does not mention lung cancer meetings or surgeon review. On the effect, Lau et al. 2013 (England, observational) found more operations where surgeons were based (20.0% vs 11.6%), but the abstract does not show the 2.4-point meeting-attendance effect we assume.",
 "unanswered_en": "No page says whether Eloisa's lung cancer meetings include a KYS thoracic surgeon.",
